      "replace": "The fleet-write relay gains one fenced op, `run_rerun_failed`. It re-runs only the failed jobs of one `ci.yml` pull-request run, once, as `objectstack-fleet[bot]`, through a relay-only seat wrapper, `scripts/pm/rerun-failed.mjs`. `.github/workflows/fleet-write.yml` is not edited: the existing stroke-scoped `permission-actions` input carries the new op (ruling 3, evidence below). The card stays open, because its last proof is the first real use on a genuine flake after this merges. No real use was made here, since the relay runs main's code.",
