kill-ratchet`, `check:pm-skill-id-lint`, `check:pm-write-pace`, `check:entry-guard`, `check:self-test-wired`, `check:merge-driver`, `check:turbo-task-graph` and `check:nul-bytes`.\n- CI: the PR's check-runs are the record. Ablation: none, because the diff is scripts, one npm script line and a doc line."
