      "replace": "- The six ruled fences do not compare the run's head with the pull's current head. A re-run of a stale head's run cancels the current head's run, because both repositories' CI concurrency groups are keyed by PR number (platform-readings). The wrapper prints the run's head sha and pull number so the seat can compare.",
